      "source": "https://shpo.nv.gov/nevadas-historical-markers/historical-markers/paradise-valley",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Between 1978 and 1982, the Library of Congress collected ethnographic data in Paradise Valley, later compiling it into 'Buckaroos in Paradise: Ranching Culture in Northern Nevada, 1945-1982'.",
